% references.bib -- bibliography for "The Mathematical Limits of AI Reliability"
%
% Every entry below was resolved through an external index before it was
% written here. DOIs went through api.crossref.org; arXiv identifiers went
% through arxiv.org/abs, and the title and first author are the ones returned,
% not the ones recalled. The audit is reproducible:
%
%     python3 audit_bib.py references.bib
%
% Two deliberate omissions, recorded so that they are not mistaken for
% oversights:
%
%   * Fano's inequality is used in the prose of §2.8 only as a comparison of
%     scales, never as a cited bound. Fano (1961) is a book whose coordinates
%     no available index confirms, so it gets no entry rather than an invented
%     page range.
%   * Lyapunov (1892) is named nowhere in this paper. (It appears in the
%     companion paper, which carries its own bib.)
%
% Cover & Thomas: the DOI 10.1002/047174882X is the second edition
% (ISBN 978-0-471-24195-9). Crossref's date fields report the 2005 online
% release; the printed second edition is dated 2006, which is the year used
% here.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

